    consumables = {
        wowhead = {
            { text = "(Unfatomable) Permafrost. Regardless of how much Absorb synergy you want to get into this build, BDK white hits are 10% of its damage AT BEST. So in an Single Target fight, 20k for a geared DK. Do we really care about 800hps absorb for a Talent point? And you are picking this over Coldthirst, which gives more kicks, in an kick rich enviroment, which also gives 1/3rd of a Deathstrike without needing a GCD? (I dont think I need to press how important any Runic Power is and how significant the use of each individual DS is when doing dangerous pulls.)", name = nil, itemId = nil, spellId = nil, slot = nil, rank = nil },
            { text = "(Unfathomable) Bloodshot. Same as before, but worse. We don't deal significant Physical damage in AoE scenarios. At all. And our Bloodshield doesnt last, no matter how big your Mastery is, to sustain DnD + HS Spam to warrant this garbage. Singletarget damage here is also not an argument, since Tanks rather focus on AoE Damage, because they can shine there, to make up for their lack of singletarget damage, since DPS can specialize better on Singletarget than a Tank.", name = nil, itemId = nil, spellId = nil, slot = nil, rank = nil },
