            { text = "(Minor) I suggest Umbilicus Internitus instead of those garbage talents. At least you can have fun looking at a Giga Shield after each Vampiric Blood, because your Bloodplagues are boosted by 30-150% dmg. And this was a very fun feature to have in Legion too. VB makes you unkillable for 15 seconds and the shield after adds some 5-10 seconds ontop of this afterwards. Great. Fun. Better than garbage Bloodshot, Ironheart.", name = nil, itemId = nil, spellId = nil, slot = nil, rank = nil },
