            "Craft Explanation This item features a unique embellishment effect that provides buffs based on your socketed gems. These effects include an Agility buff, a Critical Strike buff, and raw damage effects, all of which are strongly desirable to a Brewmaster. On top of this, its preset secondary stats of Critical Strike and Mastery are both desirable for damage or defense!",
            "Craft with and Explanation For Mythic raiders especially, many possible crafting slots are already claimed in Midnight Season 2 by elevated item level Myth-track pieces. Due to this, you may only really craft in the bracer, boots, or ring slot for a second embellishment; all three slots are effectively the same for your overall power budget in bis gear. Remember to still add the embellishment that doubles the strength of your : .",
